        "summary": "崔斯特挑选魔法卡牌，用于下次攻击，并附加额外效果。",
        "bodyHtml": "崔斯特开始洗牌，允许他<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">再次施放</span>来从3张牌中锁定一张，并且强化他的下次攻击。<br /><span>蓝牌造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/60/80/100/120 + (100% 攻击力) + (100% 法术强度) + (2300/3450/4600/5750/6900% Critical Strike Chance))魔法伤害</span>并回复<span>70/90/110/130/150法力</span>。<span>红牌对附近的敌人造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(30/45/60/75/90 + (100% 攻击力) + (70% 法术强度) + (1050/1575/2100/2625/3150% Critical Strike Chance))魔法伤害</span>和持续2.5秒的30/35/40/45/50%<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>。<span>金牌造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(15/22.5/30/37.5/45 + (100% 攻击力) + (50% 法术强度) + (375/562.5/750/937.5/1125% Critical Strike Chance))魔法伤害</span>和1/1.25/1.5/1.75/2秒<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">晕眩</span>。",
